# Only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else stays out of the build
# context, which keeps it small and keeps local state out of the image.
*
!LICENSE
!deployment/
!flumip_client/
!flumip_flutter/
!flumip_server/

# Build output and tool state, regenerated inside the build.
**/.dart_tool
**/build
**/.idea
flumip_server/web/app

# ⚠️ Never in an image: a developer's local database and Redis passwords.
flumip_server/config/passwords.yaml

# A local Docker install's secrets and data, if run from inside the repository.
deployment/docker/.env
deployment/docker/data
deployment/docker/projects
